# ⚠ MANDATORY GUARD — .klc files are UTF-16LE + CRLF.
# Git's text handling rewrites them to UTF-8/LF, after which MSKLC silently refuses
# to open the file. `-text` disables all conversion.
#
# Verify after any clone:  file -b windows/src/KBDMSSTD.klc
#   must still say: "Unicode text, UTF-16, little-endian"
*.klc -text
*.exe binary
*.dll binary

# AutoHotkey scripts are UTF-8 with BOM; keep the BOM intact.
*.ahk -text
